WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.440
I'm pretty sure Israel used to have that land.

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:02.640
I'm pretty sure you're wrong.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:06.400
They withdrew from 2005 from the land, but controlled the air.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.640
No, they don't give it to them.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.680
They control the air, the sea space, the borders,

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:12.160
the population registry.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.600
They controlled what went in and out.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.440
It was a prison, an open-air prison.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:16.280
That's not giving them freedom.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.280
But don't they have a border with Egypt and then

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.120
the Mediterranean Sea?

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.480
Yes, and the Israelis and Egyptians work together

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.340
because Donald Trump and Joe Biden and Barack Obama.

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:24.879
Yes, they're funded by the United States.

00:00:24.879 --> 00:00:27.040
Did you know that Muslim countries do bad things, too?

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.280
No, I know that they do bad things.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:29.320
Okay, then, so we're in agreement.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:30.240
All right, pause.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.080
You've been voted out.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:31.900
Please return to your seat.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:32.740
Nice to meet you.

